1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,800
O Lord, how many are my foes Many are rising against me

2
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:25,200
Many are saying of my soul There is no salvation for him in God

3
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:38,000
But you, O Lord, are a shield about me My glory and the lifter of my head

4
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:54,200
I cried aloud to the Lord and he answered me From his holy hill

5
00:00:54,200 --> 00:01:04,200
I lay down and slept I awoke again For the Lord sustained me

6
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:41,000
I will not be afraid of many thousands of people who have set themselves against me

7
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:53,800
You, O Lord, are a shield about me My glory and the lifter of my head

8
00:01:53,800 --> 00:02:08,200
I cried aloud to the Lord and he answered me From his holy hill

9
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:19,000
Rise up, Lord, save me my God You strike all my enemies on the cheek, you break the teeth of the wicked

10
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:33,500
Salvation belongs to the Lord, may your blessing be on your people
